\description{
Density, random generation, and \code{brms} custom family for a descriptive joint
model of a reaction time and a binary choice: the RT is \strong{Gaussian}, the
choice is a \strong{probit}, and the two are linked by a trial-level correlation
\code{rho}. It is the choice-and-RT counterpart of fitting \code{brms::gaussian()} to
