\itemize{
\item \code{rcogmod_gaussbit()}: Simulates random draws.
\item \code{dcogmod_gaussbit()}: Computes the density (likelihood).
\item \code{cogmod_gaussbit()}: Creates a \code{brms::custom_family()}.
\item \code{cogmod_gaussbit_stanvars()}: Generates the \code{stanvars} to pass to \code{brm()}.
}
